  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When attempting to earn a wage using Craft (maps), you earn double your check result in gold pieces instead of half your check result.</p>\n<p>When using the exploration rules (Pathfinder Roleplaying Game: Ultimate Wilderness), whenever you document a territory, you may reduce the territory's exploration DC by 2, plus 1 for every 5 ranks in an appropriate skill you possess. Additionally, whenever you attempt the last check required before creating a map or gazetteer of a territory and succeed the check by 5 or more, the list price of the map or gazetteer increases by 20%.</p>\n<p>Any circumstance bonus to exploration checks granted by maps you create is either increased by 5 or becomes equal to your ranks in Craft (maps) or Profession (cartographer) + your operative modifier, whichever is higher.</p>\n<p><strong>Associated Feat:</strong> Expert Cartographer (<em>Pathfinder Roleplaying Game: Ultimate Wilderness</em>).</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/navigation#toc13\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
